{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超出席「亞洲物流航運及空運會議」，他致辭時表示，《香港第一個五年規劃》有助鞏固本港作為國際航運中心和航空樞紐的地位。<br/>\n<br/>\n李家超在另一個論壇致辭時又提到，香港要強化「四中心、一高地」的定位，主動對接國家發展戰略。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T11:53:27.476631+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T11:37:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T14:08:37.132992+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:53.494119+00:00","content_hash":"e1bb2773c07c34a2cd0f282c3c63ecdbddda120622f9b0eb8e5921c7beeb8987","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}